[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Global Smartwatch Secondary Market Analysis — Q1 2026</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1a2332;
    --accent: #2c7be5;
    --accent-light: #e8f1fd;
    --success: #00b894;
    --warning: #fdcb6e;
    --danger: #e17055;
    --text: #2d3436;
    --text-light: #636e72;
    --bg: #f8f9fa;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --border: #e0e0e0;
    --apple-color: #636e72;
    --garmin-color: #2c7be5;
    --samsung-color: #e17055;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .report-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* Header */
  .report-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2332 0%, #2c3e50 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .report-header h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .report-header .subtitle {
    font-size: 16px;
    opacity: 0.8;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    font-size: 13px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .header-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }

  /* KPI Cards */
  .kpi-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin: -40px 0 40px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .kpi-card .kpi-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .kpi-card .kpi-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .section h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .section-intro {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .section h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
  }
  .section p { margin-bottom: 12px; }

  /* Tables */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  th {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f8f9fa; }
  tr:hover { background: var(--accent-light); }
  .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* Chart containers */
  .chart-container {
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 16px;
    background: #fafbfc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  /* Heatmap */
  .heatmap-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .heatmap-cell {
    padding: 8px 6px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: white;
  }
  .heatmap-header {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
  }
  .heatmap-label {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: right;
    padding: 8px 10px 8px 0;
  }

  /* Bar chart */
  .bar-chart { margin: 16px 0; }
  .bar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .bar-label {
    width: 120px;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 12px;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }
  .bar-track {
    flex: 1;
    height: 24px;
    background: #eee;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 40px;
  }

  /* Callout boxes */
  .callout {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-light);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .callout.warning {
    border-left-color: var(--warning);
    background: #fef9e7;
  }
  .callout.success {
    border-left-color: var(--success);
    background: #eafaf1;
  }
  .callout.danger {
    border-left-color: var(--danger);
    background: #fdf2f0;
  }
  .callout strong { color: var(--primary); }

  /* Metrics grid */
  .metrics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .metric-box {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .metric-box .metric-val {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .metric-box .metric-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* Diverging bars */
  .diverging-chart { margin: 16px 0; }
  .div-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    height: 28px;
  }
  .div-label {
    width: 130px;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .div-bar-area {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .div-center {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: -4px;
    bottom: -4px;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--text-light);
  }
  .div-bar {
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    padding: 0 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Rec cards */
  .rec-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .rec-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #fafbfc;
  }
  .rec-card h4 {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .rec-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .rec-card .rec-data {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Legend */
  .legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 8px 0 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }
  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .legend-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .report-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 0;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  /* Two-col layout */
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .kpi-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .two-col, .metrics-grid, .rec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .highlight { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .text-danger { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600; }
  .text-success { color: var(--success); font-weight: 600; }
  .small-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-light); }

  /* SVG chart */
  svg text { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ========== HEADER ========== -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="report-container">
    <h1>Global Smartwatch Secondary Market Analysis</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Q1 2026 — Pricing Dynamics, Geographic Arbitrage & Seller Behavior Intelligence</div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>3,607 Listings Analyzed</span>
      <span>3 Major Brands</span>
      <span>27 Countries</span>
      <span>1,754 Unique Sellers</span>
      <span>Report Date: April 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========== KPI CARDS ========== -->
<div class="report-container">
  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-value">$550</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Apple Median Price</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-value">$567</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Garmin Median Price</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-value">$530</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Samsung Median Price</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-value">$397</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Max Geographic Spread (Apple)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-value">48.2%</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Top 5% Seller Concentration</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW ========== -->
  <div class="section" id="market-overview">
    <h2>1. Market Overview &amp; Listing Composition</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">A high-level snapshot of 3,607 secondary-market smartwatch listings across brands, conditions, and geographies.</p>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h3>Brand Distribution</h3>
        <div class="chart-container">
          <svg width="100%" height="200" viewBox="0 0 420 200">
            <!-- Apple -->
            <rect x="40" y="20" width="275" height="40" rx="4" fill="#636e72"/>
            <text x="322" y="46" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#636e72">2,370 (65.7%)</text>
            <text x="32" y="46" font-size="13" fill="white" text-anchor="end">Apple</text>
            <!-- Garmin -->
            <rect x="40" y="75" width="87" height="40" rx="4" fill="#2c7be5"/>
            <text x="134" y="101" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#2c7be5">746 (20.7%)</text>
            <text x="32" y="101" font-size="13" fill="#2d3436" text-anchor="end">Garmin</text>
            <!-- Samsung -->
            <rect x="40" y="130" width="55" height="40" rx="4" fill="#e17055"/>
            <text x="102" y="156" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#e17055">470 (13.0%)</text>
            <text x="32" y="156" font-size="13" fill="#2d3436" text-anchor="end">Samsung</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>Apple dominates the secondary market with nearly two-thirds of all listings. Garmin and Samsung compete for the remainder, with Garmin holding a slight edge.</p>
        <p class="small-note">21 listings from minor brands (Xiaomi, Other) excluded from brand-level analysis. Analysis uses 3,586 listings across the three core brands.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Condition Mix</h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Condition</th><th class="num">Listings</th><th class="num">Share</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>New</td><td class="num">1,553</td><td class="num">43.0%</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Used</td><td class="num">1,250</td><td class="num">34.6%</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Open Box</td><td class="num">581</td><td class="num">16.1%</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Refurbished (all grades)</td><td class="num">182</td><td class="num">5.0%</td></tr>
            <tr><td>For parts / not working</td><td class="num">21</td><td class="num">0.6%</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>New items account for the largest share (43%), indicating significant retail arbitrage and channel-overflow activity. Apple skews more toward Used (40%) and Open Box (21%), while Garmin (67% New) and Samsung (63% New) are more heavily new-stock dominated.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Geographic Spread</h3>
    <div class="chart-container">
      <div class="chart-title">Listings by Country (Top 10)</div>
      <div class="bar-chart">
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">United States</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:100%;background:var(--accent);">2,354 (65.3%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">United Kingdom</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:20%;background:var(--accent);">471 (13.1%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">South Korea</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:9.1%;background:var(--accent);">213 (5.9%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Japan</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:7.9%;background:var(--accent);">185 (5.1%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Italy</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:5.6%;background:var(--accent);">132 (3.7%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Canada</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:3.7%;background:var(--accent);">87 (2.4%)</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Germany</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:1.6%;background:var(--accent);">37</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Malaysia</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:1.1%;background:var(--accent);">25</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Hong Kong</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:1.0%;background:var(--accent);">24</div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><div class="bar-label">Australia</div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:0.98%;background:var(--accent);">23</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>The U.S. represents nearly two-thirds of all listings, making it the baseline market for pricing comparisons. The UK is the second-largest source with meaningful volume across all three brands. East Asian markets (Japan, South Korea, Hong Kong) collectively account for ~11% and show distinct pricing patterns explored in Section 3.</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Apple's dominance in listing volume does not translate to the highest resale prices. Garmin commands the highest median ($567) despite representing only 21% of listings — a signal of stronger brand value retention in the secondary market.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== SECTION 2: BRAND PRICING ========== -->
  <div class="section" id="brand-pricing-analysis">
    <h2>2. Brand-Level Pricing &amp; Value Retention</h2>
